Modifications made by the Frankfurt AI Safety RM-Bias Working Group, 2026:

  * Added a demographic / intersectional protected-attribute pipeline: matched-pair
    generation over real corpora (UCI German Credit, Bias in Bios, PERSUADE 2.0, ASAP-AES),
    a single-axis structural validation gate, a self-describing manifest, and a domain
    registry (substrates/, pairs/).
  * Added the positioned-argument (standpoint-credibility) arm and the model-response arms
    (decision-response, reasoning 2x2).
  * Added LEACE + non-linear-probe concept-erasure analysis on top of the upstream
    difference-of-means probe and null-space projection (probes/).
  * Added cluster deployment for the hessian.AI 42 cluster (cluster/) and a static
    experiment-review site generator (review_site/).
  * Removed the upstream length / position / sycophancy / uncertainty bias arms, the
    RewardBench and perplexity evaluations, and the MLX (Apple Silicon) backend. This
    repository does not reproduce the upstream results.

